{"lyrics":"[00:00.00] [Instrumental Intro]\n[Intro]\n[00:10.14] I've been—\n[00:10.88] Left all of my demons at home (This is a JCraig product)\n[00:17.72] Lonely road, oh-oh, oh\n[Chorus]\n[00:19.94] As I walk this lonely road, I left all of my demons at home\n[00:22.96] I've been gettin' high all on my own, to survive (PD)\n[00:32.76] As I walk this lonely road, I left all of my demons at home\n[00:41.08] I've been gettin' high all on my own, to survive\n[Verse 1]\n[00:50.08] Now, it's getting cold\n[00:53.66] I put Gucci all over my coat\n[00:57.34] Said my goodbyes, wrote them down in a note\n[01:01.52] Baby, I'm gone\n[01:06.80] What's life without happiness?\n[01:08.88] What's life without satisfaction?\n[01:10.98] Got me thinkin' 'bout the past again\n[01:13.08] Wishin' some of that never happened\n[01:15.20] Everyday I'm gettin' faded\n[01:17.20] Tryin' to replace this painstaking torture (PD)\n[01:23.54] Babe, I've seen the craziest things, the craziest things\n[01:30.46] Tomorrow may bring a new day\n[01:34.98] But today, I suffer from the same stuff\n[Chorus]\n[01:39.56] As I walk this lonely road, I left all of my demons at home\n[01:47.82] I've been gettin' high all on my own, to survive (PD)\n[01:56.24] As I walk this lonely road, I left all of my demons at home\n[02:04.54] I've been gettin' high all on my own, to survive\n[02:09.86] As I walk this lonely road, I left all of my demons at home\n[02:21.22] I've been gettin' high all on my own, to survive\n[02:29.86] As I walk this lonely road, I left all of my demons at home\n[02:37.92] I've been gettin' high all on my own, to survive (PD)\n[Verse 2]\n[02:46.78] Promethazine is just a remedy, hunnid on me like a centipede\n[02:51.14] Walk around in the darkness, don't care\n[02:55.30] Wonder if I found some company over there\n[02:58.60] I ain't only lonely, baby, not scared\n[03:03.68] I may be lonely, but I'm not scared\n[03:07.82] Demons in my vision, I don't know how to face them\n[03:12.04] All these exes in my life, had to replace them\n[03:15.80] Irreplaceable, untraceable\n[03:20.32] Pull up in a new drop top, tryna fuck on a hot thot\n[03:24.50] Demons jumping on me, hopscotch\n[03:26.58] Sorrow on me, baby, nonstop\n[03:28.68] Here we go, here we go, here it comes, ready\n[03:33.00] Oh, it's cold on my chest, feeling like I need a yeti, uh, uh\n[03:37.08] Everything gon' blow up in my face, baby\n[03:39.12] I ain't talking confetti, yeah, yeah\n[03:41.20] Shoot you in your left eye, lil' bitch\n[03:43.30] Have you looking like Fetty, yeah, woah\n[03:45.36] Here it go\n[03:45.96] Wasn't the same nigga that I was like a year ago, It's a miracle\n[03:50.60] That was one more perc, It took one more perc to work, to work\n[Chorus]\n[03:56.96] As I walk this lonely road, I left all of my demons at home\n[04:18.12] I've been gettin' high all on my own, to survive (PD)\n[04:23.28] As I walk this lonely road, I left all of my demons at home\n[04:28.96] I've been gettin' high all on my own, to survive\n[04:43.42] As I walk this lonely road, I left all of my demons at home\n[04:51.50] I've been gettin' high all on my own, to survive\n[05:00.02] As I walk this lonely road, I left all of my demons at home\n[05:04.88] I've been gettin' high all on my own, to survive (PD)","words":[[0.0,1.0,"[00:00.00]"],[3.58,6.94,"[Instrumental"],[9.38,9.5,"Intro]"],[9.8,10.06,"[Intro]"],[10.08,10.1,"[00:09.80]"],[10.14,10.42,"I've"],[10.48,10.78,"been—"],[10.8,10.82,"[00:10.92]"],[10.88,12.16,"Left"],[12.24,13.6,"all"],[13.64,14.9,"of"],[15.68,15.7,"my"],[15.96,16.3,"demons"],[16.4,16.44,"at"],[16.48,16.54,"home"],[16.58,16.64,"(This"],[16.68,16.7,"is"],[16.76,16.76,"a"],[16.86,16.98,"JCraig"],[17.02,17.62,"product)"],[17.64,17.68,"[00:17.72]"],[17.72,18.46,"Lonely"],[18.5,18.68,"road,"],[18.72,19.06,"oh-oh,"],[19.1,19.12,"oh"],[19.16,19.32,"[Chorus]"],[19.34,19.48,"[00:19.94]"],[19.94,19.98,"As"],[20.08,20.08,"I"],[20.12,20.22,"walk"],[20.26,20.36,"this"],[20.4,20.5,"lonely"],[20.54